; SLICE TEST art (roms/slice-test/slice-test.scr links it with ASSET "slice-test.art").
; Pixels are colour indices 0-7 ('.' = 0, transparent); tools/art.ts converts each block to
; Barndoor planar tiles (24 bytes a tile) at build time. Drawn for this project.
;
; Background palette 0: 1 floor, 2 floor fleck, 3 brick, 4 mortar, 5 text.
; Sprite palettes: lamplighter (1 coat, 2 face, 3 lantern glass, 4 hair/boots/lantern),
; lamp (1 iron, 2 dark glass, 3 flame, 4 flame core), spark (1-3 hot to white).

@tiles FLOOR
11111111
11121111
11111111
11111211
11111111
12111111
11111111
11111111

@tiles WALL                ; brick
33343333
33343333
33343333
44444444
33333334
33333334
33333334
44444444

